1
00:00:00,499 --> 00:00:03,339
(Penny:)-You're extorting a date out of me?
-I kind of have to.

2
00:00:03,502 --> 00:00:07,252
(Stuart:)The cousin who's getting married is
the cousin I usually go to weddings with.

3
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:11,510
(Penny:)-Can I bring Leonard?
-Sure. What the hell?

4
00:00:12,094 --> 00:00:14,844
(Leonard:)-Deal.
-We'll tell people he's your cousin.

5
00:00:17,516 --> 00:00:20,186
(Sheldon:)This is Stan Lee's front door.

6
00:00:20,352 --> 00:00:23,352
(Sheldon:)We were on Stan Lee's curb,
then we were on Stan Lee's walk...

7
00:00:23,522 --> 00:00:26,312
(Sheldon:)-...and now we're at Stan Lee's front door.
-Yep.

8
00:00:26,483 --> 00:00:27,523
[DOORBELL RINGS]

9
00:00:27,692 --> 00:00:31,532
(Sheldon:)Oh, Lord, you just rang Stan Lee's
doorbell at Stan Lee's house.

10
00:00:31,696 --> 00:00:34,616
(Sheldon:)We're about to go in and
have milk and cookies with Stan Lee.

11
00:00:34,783 --> 00:00:38,413
(Penny:)Sweetie, I don't know if we're gonna
have cookies or what's gonna happen...

12
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:41,120
(Penny:)...so just let me talk and--

13
00:00:41,414 --> 00:00:42,954
(Penny:)Yeah?

14
00:00:45,627 --> 00:00:49,217
(Penny:)-Are you Stan Lee?
-Oh, damn.

15
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,800
(Penny:)Hi. I'm Penny.
This is my friend Sheldon.

16
00:00:51,967 --> 00:00:55,387
(Sheldon:)We're not friends at the moment.
Depends on how this goes.

17
00:00:55,554 --> 00:00:58,514
(Penny:)Right, right. Anyway,
Sheldon here is a huge fan of yours.

